# Afrobeats / afropop hooks (style: latin, substyle: afrobeats): 8 verses, 6 pre-choruses, 7 choruses, 4 bridges.
# Relaxed off-beat entries, 3-3-2 figures, pentatonic shapes, short chantable call-and-response phrases over gentle
# major loops (Fmaj7-G-Em7-Am7, I-IV-vi-V). Sung pitch, C4 = middle C.

